The type operations in src/lattice.rs adapt algorithms from Erlang/OTP
lib/dialyzer/src/erl_types.erl. The OTP 28 domain is pinned to OTP-28.3,
commit ab489c0b260c637a9487f8753909ea94dacbbec2. The OTP 29 domain adapts
OTP-29.1.2, including native-record type operations in src/lattice/records.rs.
These Rust adaptations are modified from the original Erlang implementation.

